### Create a transaction
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/create
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "merchant-a",
  "reference": "order-3001",
  "amount": 25.50,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolder": "Test Holder One",
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Get one transaction
GET {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### List a merchant's transactions
GET {{host}}/api/v1/transactions?merchantId=merchant-a
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### Search by reference
GET {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/search?reference=order-10
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### Capture
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/1/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### Refund
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/3/refund?amount=20.00&reason=customer%20request
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### Void
GET {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/5/void
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}

# curl example:
# curl -X POST "http://localhost:8081/api/v1/transactions/3/refund?amount=20.00" -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>"
